  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two forces, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F_{1}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F_{2}\"></span>, each of magnitude <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span>, act on a rod as shown on the diagram.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>The net torque on the rod is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\tau\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the length of the rod?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\tau F\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\tau}{F}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2\\tau}{F}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\tau}{2F}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
